{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/queue/next.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:38.617597Z","id":"be5745164e0e181363a840b1310f6e7e67edfe2ac31b472e27204e01ffeef1d4","body":{"detail":"A turn failed for the network sets waitingFor: claude and emits one ProbeClaude (update.dart TurnFailed). Its answer ClaudeReachable(false) leaves the job waiting with no further probe until Woke(foreground: true) (update.dart Woke). Task 25's EffectRunner (with ApiConnection) has to keep watching and send ClaudeReachable(true) when the connection is back, or jobs waiting on Claude stay waiting while the app is in the foreground. Alternatively a Tick could re-probe on a backoff.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":325},"end":{"line":329},"content_hash":"e70163bea29427fd4d844631bdd3bb8f2162c5dd1e3571caa3123ac98310ad30"},"summary":"The queue probes Claude once per wait: after ClaudeReachable(false) it probes again only on Woke(foreground: true), so the runner must send ClaudeReachable(true) when Claude answers again","tags":["queue","runner","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
